{
"#name"
:
{
"ccal"
:
null
,
"en"
:
"Chinese Lunar Calendar"
,
"cn"
:
"中国农历"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
{
"x ccal [subcommand] [options]"
:
null
}
,
{
"x ccal info --[yml|tsv|csv|tty] [date]"
:
null
}
,
{
"x ccal ls --[yml|tsv|csv|tty] [date]"
:
null
}
,
{
"x ccal around --[yml|tsv|csv|tty] [date]"
:
null
}
,
{
"x ccal tiaoxiu --[yml|tsv|csv|tty] [date] [-n count]"
:
null
}
,
{
"x ccal fz|fzd"
:
null
}
,
{
"x ccal fzm|fzy"
:
null
}
,
{
"x ccal --cfg <key=value>"
:
null
}
]
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"The ccal module is a terminal-based calendar tool designed for Chinese users.\nIt provides a clear view of both Gregorian and lunar calendars, including solar terms,\ntraditional Chinese holidays, sexagenary cycle (heavenly stems and earthly branches),\nsix-day cycle, and daily almanac guidance for auspicious and inauspicious activities.\nIdeal for checking Chinese festivals or consulting the traditional calendar for daily planning.\n"
,
"cn"
:
"ccal 模块是专为中文用户设计的终端日历工具，支持农历、节气和传统节日的显示。\n它以简洁的方式呈现公历与农历对照日历，并提供干支纪年、黄历宜忌、六曜等信息，\n适合查阅每日黄历或节日安排。\n"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"输出模式自动检测：\n- TTY (终端): 彩色日历或表格输出\n- Pipe/非TTY: YML 格式输出（AI 可解析）\n可通过 --yml|--tsv|--csv|--tty 强制指定格式\n"
,
"en"
:
"Output mode auto-detection:\n- TTY (terminal): colorful calendar or table output\n- Pipe/non-TTY: YML format output (AI parseable)\nUse --yml|--tsv|--csv|--tty to force specific format\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x ccal"
,
"en"
:
"Interactively view calendar (equivalent to 'x ccal fz')"
,
"cn"
:
"交互式查看日历，等同于 'x ccal fz'"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ccal info --yml 2026-05-09"
,
"en"
:
"View calendar for May 9, 2026"
,
"cn"
:
"查看 2026 年 5 月 9 号的日历"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ccal ls --yml 2026-05"
,
"en"
:
"List month data for May 2026"
,
"cn"
:
"列出 2026 年 5 月的月数据"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ccal around --yml 2026-05-09"
,
"en"
:
"View ±7 days around May 9, 2026"
,
"cn"
:
"查看 2026 年 5 月 9 号前后7天"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ccal tiaoxiu --yml 2026-05-01"
,
"en"
:
"View upcoming holidays and weekends from May 2026"
,
"cn"
:
"查看 2026 年 5 月起的放假和周末安排"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ccal fzm"
,
"en"
:
"Interactively view solar terms, holidays, make-up work days for each month"
,
"cn"
:
"交互式查看每月的节气、放假、调休上班日期"
}
]
,
"#subcmd:View"
:
[
"info"
,
"ls"
,
"around"
,
"tiaoxiu"
,
"fz"
,
"fzm"
,
"fzy"
]
,
"#subcmd:Config"
:
[
"--cfg"
,
"--cur"
]
,
"#subcmd:Other"
:
[
"update"
]
,
"fz|fzd"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Use fzf to provide an interactive calendar interface, allowing quick jumps to specific dates or holidays"
,
"cn"
:
"使用 fzf 交互式查看日历，可快速跳转到指定日期或节日"
}
}
,
"fzm"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Interactively view the solar terms, holidays, and make-up work days for each month"
,
"cn"
:
"交互式查看每月的节气、放假、调休上班日期"
}
}
,
"fzy"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Interactively view the dates of traditional festivals, zodiac animals, and leap months for each year"
,
"cn"
:
"交互式查看每年的传统节日日期、生肖、闰月"
}
}
,
"around"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"View ±7 days around a specified date (15 days total), showing day-level calendar data.\n\nExample:\n    x ccal around --yml 2026-05-09\n    x ccal around --tsv t\n\nData provided: date, lunar_date, jianchu (值星), weekday, jieqi, xiuxi (休/工), yi (宜), ji (忌), holiday\n\nOutput mode auto-detection:\n- TTY (terminal): readable table format\n- Pipe/non-TTY: YML list format for AI\n"
,
"cn"
:
"查看指定日期前后7天（共15天）的日历数据。\n\n示例:\n    x ccal around --yml 2026-05-09\n    x ccal around --tsv t\n\n提供数据：日期、农历、值星、星期、节气、休息/工作(休/工)、宜、忌、假日\n\n输出模式自动检测：\n- TTY (终端): 可读的表格格式\n- Pipe/非TTY: YML 列表格式供 AI 使用\n"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Date (YYYY-MM-DD, defaults to today)"
,
"cn"
:
"日期 (YYYY-MM-DD，默认为今日)"
}
}
,
"--yml"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Output in YML list format. Each item starts with '- ' making it valid YAML list."
,
"cn"
:
"以 YML 列表格式输出。每项以 '- ' 开头，形成有效的 YAML 列表"
}
}
,
"--tsv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Output in TSV (tab-separated values) format"
,
"cn"
:
"以 TSV（制表符分隔）格式输出"
}
}
,
"--csv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Output in CSV (comma-separated values) format"
,
"cn"
:
"以 CSV（逗号分隔）格式输出"
}
}
,
"--tty"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Force TTY mode (table format output)"
,
"cn"
:
"强制 TTY 模式（表格格式输出）"
}
}
}
,
"tiaoxiu"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"View upcoming holidays, weekends (休), and make-up work days (工) from a starting date.\n\nIncludes:\n- Official holidays (劳动节, 清明节, etc.)\n- Weekends marked as 休\n- Make-up work days marked as 工 (调休上班日)\n- Reason field shows the actual holiday causing the day off\n\nExample:\n    x ccal tiaoxiu --yml 2026-05-01\n    x ccal tiaoxiu --tsv -n 30 2026-05-01\n\nOutput fields: date, lunar_date, weekday, xiuxi (休/工), reason\n\nOutput mode auto-detection:\n- TTY (terminal): readable table format with color coding\n- Pipe/non-TTY: YML list format for AI\n"
,
"cn"
:
"查看从指定日期开始的放假安排、周末（休）和调休上班日（工）。\n\n包含：\n- 法定假日（劳动节、清明节等）\n- 标记为\"休\"的周末\n- 标记为\"工\"的调休上班日\n- reason 字段显示实际导致该天休息的假期\n\n示例:\n    x ccal tiaoxiu --yml 2026-05-01\n    x ccal tiaoxiu --tsv -n 30 2026-05-01\n\n输出字段：日期、农历、星期、休息/工作(休/工)、原因（默认100天内）\n\n输出模式自动检测：\n- TTY (终端): 带颜色可读的表格格式\n- Pipe/非TTY: YML 列表格式供 AI 使用\n"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Start date (YYYY-MM-DD, defaults to today)"
,
"cn"
:
"开始日期 (YYYY-MM-DD，默认为今日)"
}
}
,
"-n|--count"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Number of days to look ahead (default: 100)"
,
"cn"
:
"查看的天数（默认：100天）"
}
}
,
"--yml"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Output in YML list format."
,
"cn"
:
"以 YML 列表格式输出"
}
}
,
"--tsv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Output in TSV (tab-separated values) format"
,
"cn"
:
"以 TSV（制表符分隔）格式输出"
}
}
,
"--csv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Output in CSV (comma-separated values) format"
,
"cn"
:
"以 CSV（逗号分隔）格式输出"
}
}
,
"--tty"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Force TTY mode (table format output)"
,
"cn"
:
"强制 TTY 模式（表格格式输出）"
}
}
}
,
"info"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"View detailed calendar information for a specified date, defaulting to the current day.\n\nExample:\n    x ccal info --yml 2026-05-09\n    x ccal info --tsv 2026-05\n    x ccal info --tty 2026-05-09\n\nFields provided: date, lunar_date, lunar_daycount, jianchu (值星), weekday,\nbazi (干支), jieqi (节气), jieqi_next, holiday, xiuxi (休/工), yi (宜), ji (忌)\n\nOutput mode auto-detection:\n- TTY (terminal): uses 'x ccal draw' to render colorful calendar\n- Pipe/non-TTY: outputs YML format for AI agents\n"
,
"cn"
:
"查看指定日期的详细日历信息，默认为当日。\n\n示例:\n    x ccal info --yml 2026-05-09\n    x ccal info --tsv 2026-05\n    x ccal info --tty 2026-05-09\n\n提供字段：日期、农历、农历月大小、值星、星期、干支、节气、下个节气、假日、休息/工作、宜、忌\n\n输出模式自动检测:\n- TTY (终端): 使用 x ccal draw 绘制彩色日历\n- Pipe/非TTY: 输出 YML 格式供 AI 使用\n"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Date (YYYY-MM-DD, defaults to today)"
,
"cn"
:
"日期 (YYYY-MM-DD，默认为今日)"
}
}
,
"--yml"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Output in YML format (key: value pairs). Ideal for AI parsing from pipe."
,
"cn"
:
"以 YML 格式输出（键值对）。适合 AI 从管道解析"
}
}
,
"--tsv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Output in TSV (tab-separated values) format"
,
"cn"
:
"以 TSV（制表符分隔）格式输出"
}
}
,
"--csv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Output in CSV (comma-separated values) format"
,
"cn"
:
"以 CSV（逗号分隔）格式输出"
}
}
,
"--tty"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Force TTY mode (colorful calendar output)"
,
"cn"
:
"强制 TTY 模式（彩色日历输出）"
}
}
}
,
"ls"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"List calendar data in various formats (day/week/month/year view).\n\nExample:\n    x ccal ls --yml 2026-05\n    x ccal ls --yml 2026-05 | x ccal info --yml 2026-05-01\n    x ccal ls --tsv 2026\n\nData provided:\n- Day/Month view: date, lunar_date, jianchu (值星), weekday, jieqi, xiuxi (休/工), yi (宜), ji (忌), holiday\n- Month summary: year_month, jieqi_list, tiaoxiu_xiu (放假), tiaoxiu_gong (上班)\n- Year view: year, xuanyuan, shengxiao, leap_months, chunjie, qingming, duanwu, zhongqiu\n\nOutput mode auto-detection:\n- TTY (terminal): readable table format\n- Pipe/non-TTY: YML list format for AI\n"
,
"cn"
:
"以多种格式列出日历数据（按日/周/月/年查看）。\n\n示例:\n    x ccal ls --yml 2026-05\n    x ccal ls --yml 2026-05 | x ccal info --yml 2026-05-01\n    x ccal ls --tsv 2026\n\n提供的数据：\n- 日/月视图: 日期、农历、值星、星期、节气、休息/工作(休/工)、宜、忌、假日\n- 月汇总: 年月、节气列表、调休放假、调休上班\n- 年视图: 生肖、闰月、春节、清明、端午、中秋\n\n输出模式自动检测:\n- TTY (终端): 可读的表格格式\n- Pipe/非TTY: YML 列表格式供 AI 使用\n"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Date (YYYY-MM-DD), Month (YYYY-MM), or Year (YYYY). Defaults to today."
,
"cn"
:
